   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "In a small group or on your own, reflect on a business problem in your current organization (work or school).\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha\">\n<li>Identify an opportunity for improvement in your organization’s function or operation.</li>\n<li>Who would you enlist to assist with requirements gathering?</li>\n<li>What tools will you use to assist your efforts?</li>\n<li>What are some other factors you should consider?</li>\n</ol>",
